    ("h3", """1.9.2 Software"""),
    ("p", """The software stack, summarised in Table 1.2, is centred on the Python scientific computing ecosystem. PyTorch 2.x with torchvision supplies the ImageNet pretrained backbones; pytorch-grad-cam, shap and lime supply the XAI methods; Streamlit provides the forensic interface; fpdf2 and Jinja2 generate the PDF reports; and Git with GitHub provides version control and reproducibility."""),
